  "observations": [
    "14 current Room entities, schema snapshots 1..9 and eight declared adjacent auto-migrations; this is not an all-version data-preservation pass.",
    "Only Exposure has a declared SQL foreign key, to SurfaceEpisode; FactOrigin is a polymorphic sidecar with owner-enforced lifecycle.",
    "AppUsageEvent has package, consent epoch, wall timestamp and numeric kind; no stored historical zone/boot/order/multiplicity evidence.",
    "Exposure retains only accumulated playback/qualification/completion, not a durable segment stream that can be reinterpreted later.",
    "InterventionEvent retains displayed intervention/choice summary; no complete attempt/outcome/lifecycle event stream.",
    "Production usage key is epoch+timestamp+kind+package hashed for overlap dedup; equal tuples cannot preserve separate same-timestamp multiplicity.",
    "Usage fact inserts and queryThroughMs update share a write transaction; SQL foreign key and semantic constraints still need direct adversarial qualification.",
    "Current archives have 20 MiB plaintext and 100000-row ceilings; logical reader accepts version2/schema9. Lifetime incremental archives and cross-version logical migration are not qualified."
  ],
  "evidenceLimits": [
    "No live history read; no schema, migration, collector, consent, permission or backup default change.",
    "No all-version migration, crash, ENOSPC, max-history, fsync or new behavior-source acceptance.",
    "No assumption that more columns enable an unsupported observation or historical backfill."
  ],
